</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- HEADER -->
<div class="report-header">
  <div class="header-inner">
    <div class="header-badge">Trend Analysis Report</div>
    <h1>BIEK Computer Science 12th Class<br>Past Paper Analysis (2015–2025)</h1>
    <p>A comprehensive 11-year examination trend analysis covering question type distribution, year-over-year volume changes, and recurring topic patterns — designed to support educators and curriculum planners.</p>
    <div class="header-meta">
      <span>&#128197; Generated: April 21, 2026</span>
      <span>&#127979; Audience: Educators &amp; Curriculum Planners</span>
      <span>&#128202; 327 Questions Analysed</span>
      <span>&#128279; Source: BIEK HSC Part-2 Papers</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- TOC -->
<div class="container">
<div class="toc-card">
  <h2>Table of Contents</h2>
  <ul class="toc-list">
    <li><a href="#overview"><span class="toc-num">01</span>Dataset &amp; Examination Overview</a></li>
    <li><a href="#yearly"><span class="toc-num">02</span>Year-by-Year Question Volume</a></li>
    <li><a href="#qtype"><span class="toc-num">03</span>Question Type Composition &amp; Trends</a></li>
    <li><a href="#topics"><span class="toc-num">04</span>Recurring Topics &amp; Content Patterns</a></li>
    <li><a href="#insights"><span class="toc-num">05</span>Strategic Insights for Exam Preparation</a></li>
    <li><a href="#conclusions"><span class="toc-num">06</span>Conclusions &amp; Limitations</a></li>
  </ul>
</div>

<!-- EXECUTIVE SUMMARY -->
<div class="callout">
  <strong>Executive Summary:</strong> The BIEK Computer Science HSC Part-2 exam shows a broadly stable structure — MCQs have been constant at 15 per year throughout 2015–2025. A key structural shift occurred in 2017 when Short Questions expanded from 9 to 18 (a +100% increase), then settled to 15 from 2021 onward. Long Questions have remained unchanged at exactly 3 per year. The year 2020 is absent from the dataset. Thematically, Data Types &amp; Variables, DBMS/Database concepts, and I/O/Format specifiers dominate the question bank — together appearing in over 200 of 327 questions.
</div>

<!-- ========== SECTION 1: OVERVIEW ========== -->
<div class="section" id="overview">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-icon">&#128203;</div>
    <h2>1. Dataset &amp; Examination Overview</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="kpi-grid">
    <div class="kpi-card blue">
      <div class="kpi-value">327</div>
      <div class="kpi-label">Total Questions</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Across 10 exam years</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card blue">
      <div class="kpi-value">10</div>
      <div class="kpi-label">Exam Years</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">2015–2025 (2020 missing)</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card blue">
      <div class="kpi-value">150</div>
      <div class="kpi-label">MCQ Questions</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">45.9% of total · 15/year</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card green">
      <div class="kpi-value">147</div>
      <div class="kpi-label">Short Questions</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">45.0% of total · avg 14.7/yr</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card red">
      <div class="kpi-value">30</div>
      <div class="kpi-label">Long Questions</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">9.2% of total · 3/year</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card purple">
      <div class="kpi-value">32.7</div>
      <div class="kpi-label">Avg Questions/Year</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Range: 27–36</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="exec-grid">
    <div class="exec-block">
      <h4>Coverage Scope</h4>
      <p>Covers BIEK Computer Science Paper-II (theory) from 2015 to 2025. Questions span C Programming language fundamentals and Database Management Systems (DBMS/MS-Access). All 327 questions are in English.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="exec-block">
      <h4>Question Format</h4>
      <p>Each paper contains three sections: <strong>MCQs</strong> (objective, 4 options), <strong>Short Questions</strong> (brief answers, definitions, code snippets), and <strong>Long Questions</strong> (essay-type with multiple sub-parts a/b/c).</p>
    </div>
    <div class="exec-block">
      <h4>Key Structural Facts</h4>
      <p>MCQs: <strong>constant at 15/year</strong>. Long Qs: <strong>constant at 3/year</strong>. Short Qs: <strong>varied</strong> — 9 (2015–16), 18 (2017–19), 15 (2021–25). Year 2020 is absent from the dataset.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title">Overall Question Type Distribution</div>
    <div class="legend">
      <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-dot" style="background:#2563eb"></div>MCQs (45.9%)</div>
      <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-dot" style="background:#16a34a"></div>Short (45.0%)</div>
      <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-dot" style="background:#dc2626"></div>Long (9.2%)</div>
    </div>
    <div style="max-width:340px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="pieOverall"></canvas></div>
    </div>
  </div>
